OL,3,GNEWSAB&B resists calls from Airbnb to
OL,4,Achange logo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seaside bed and breakfast says it is
OL,7,Fresisting legal requests from
OL,8,Faccommodation marketplace Airbnb to
OL,9,Fchange its logo.
OL,11,FBnb-side in Portland, Dorset, was
OL,12,Ffounded by the B-side arts festival
OL,13,Fthree years ago to help financially
OL,14,Fsupport the not-for-profit
OL,15,Forganisation.
OL,17,FIt said it was contacted by Airbnb
OL,18,Fafter applying to register the Bnb-side
OL,19,Flogo as a trademark.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
