OL,3,GNEWSAB&B resists calls from Airbnb to
OL,4,Achange logo
OL,5,
OL,6,FB-side said the US-based firm claimed
OL,7,Fthe six-bedroom guesthouse could
OL,8,Funfairly benefit from, or even damage,
OL,9,FAirbnb's reputation and the trademark
OL,10,Fwould cause confusion. Airbnb has been
OL,11,Fapproached for a comment.
